            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Needs to follow existing patterns.  Happy to discuss how the patterns suck (they do), and we should refactor to something better as a whole, but not as part of a new feature and not only on one resource handler.  We're better off keeping things the way they are than having one thing bespoke."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "Fair point. I'll think about it in more depth and come back to you on that topic. Regarding this patch, I now just stick to extracting the lambdas into separate handler functions using the existing pattern."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 383,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 383,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "Not entirely sure what what this could mean.. I have kept the TBD, since technically, the way EventLog for multi-host ComputerSystem should work, would be to have EventLogs specific to each host and being able to serve the logs via said resource on a multi-host platform. I see this capability being introduced someday, so might aswell keep the TBD. Or is it about something else? I don't think I have mispelled it :D"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 383,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "@ed@tanous.net can I close this?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 383,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "We shouldn't have TBD in code intended for master, but I now realize this came from other code, so it's fine."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 408,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Please do not organize code this way.   We currently have a unique entry point for each verb.  I do appreciate you trying to reduce duplication, but we should avoid duplication as a whole, not on a per-route basis."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems_logservices_dbus_eventlog.hpp",
                    "line": 408,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
